---
---
<section class="bg-black py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-4">The Programme</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white">Three Days. Three Pillars.<br>One Foundation.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-[#FFD100]/10">

      <div class="bg-[#1a1a1a] p-10">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-3">Day One · August 12</div>
        <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-5">Make Money</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          {['How money is made', 'God\'s purpose for wealth', 'The role of skill and favour', 'How to build both', 'Guest Missionary appearance'].map((t) => (
            <li class="text-sm text-white/55 border-b border-white/10 pb-3">{t}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#FFD100] mt-6 mb-3">Breakout Sessions</span>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          {['Creatives · Professionals · Entrepreneurs', 'Mental Health · Self-Awareness · Working with People'].map((t) => (
            <li class="text-sm text-white/55 border-b border-white/10 pb-3">{t}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FFD100] p-10">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-black/40 mb-3">Day Two · August 13</div>
        <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-black mb-5">Manage Money</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          {['Goal setting and vision boarding', 'Income vs wealth', 'Budgeting, planning, and stewardship', 'Debt, giving, and tithing', 'When money becomes god', 'Money Personality assessment'].map((t) => (
            <li class="text-sm text-black/60 border-b border-black/10 pb-3">{t}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#1a1a1a] p-10">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-3">Day Three · August 14</div>
        <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-5">Multiply Money</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          {['Why investing is the key to wealth', 'Grace, blessing, and navigating the harvest', 'Various investment options', 'Investment pitfalls to avoid', 'How to start investing now'].map((t) => (
            <li class="text-sm text-white/55 border-b border-white/10 pb-3">{t}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#FFD100] mt-6 mb-3">Breakout Sessions</span>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          {['Trading vs Investing', 'Assets of the Future (crypto etc.)'].map((t) => (
            <li class="text-sm text-white/55 border-b border-white/10 pb-3">{t}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
